{%- doc -%}
  The quick-add modal singleton — the shared <quick-add-dialog> that
  hz-quick-add.js morphs fetched product content into.

  UNWIRED from M&P card surfaces (Phase 13 round 3 — Dawn-native quick-add
  ruling, Nathan 2026-07-07): no host renders this singleton anymore —
  quick-add on cards is Dawn's per-card machinery
  (snippets/hz-card-quick-add). Stays in-repo as ported vocabulary
  (port-everything frame); re-wire = restore the host singleton renders +
  swap the gallery render back to snippets/quick-add.

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) snippets/quick-add-modal.liquid
  (horizon-blocks Phase 13). Deviations:
  - data-section-id="hz-quick-add-product" added to the product-component:
    documents the SRA contract (the modal content is the Section Rendering
    API fragment of sections/hz-quick-add-product; initial fetch in
    hz-quick-add.js, in-modal variant changes via variant-picker.js's
    SECTION_ID_MAP entry).
  - icon-close.svg → hz-icon-close.svg (Dawn owns the stock name; the hz-
    copy is byte-verbatim stock). accessibility.close_dialog hardcoded
    English.
  - Eager module script tags EXTENDED beyond stock's gift-card-recipient-form.js:
    the modal content arrives via fetch + morph, and morphed <script> tags
    never execute — in stock every element definition ships in the global
    scripts.liquid bundle, but our port loads per-render, so the singleton
    (real server-rendered markup on the host page) must pre-load everything
    the morphed content defines: hz-quick-add.js (quick-add-dialog itself),
    hz-product-form.js, component-quantity-selector.js, hz-price-per-item.js,
    volume-pricing.js, theme-drawer.js, local-pickup.js.
    (<variant-picker> is already defined on card hosts via product-card.js's
    @theme/variant-picker import.) Phase-13 serve fix adds
    hz-cart-bubble-sync.js (Dawn-glue — see its header; punchlist §3.4).
  - render 'product-media-gallery-content-styles' TRIMMED: that snippet is
    the PDP media-gallery styles, unported. RE-ADD with the PDP media slice
    (the modal's minimal-media column needs no gallery rules; stock modal
    CSS handles the wrapper).

  Rendered by sections/hz-product-list.liquid + hz-product-recommendations.liquid
  when either quick-add setting is on. Duplicate hosts on one page render
  duplicate singletons; getElementById resolves to the FIRST — consistent
  first-wins, serve-probed.
{%- enddoc -%}

<script
  src="{{ 'gift-card-recipient-form.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'hz-quick-add.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'hz-product-form.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'component-quantity-selector.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'hz-price-per-item.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'volume-pricing.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'theme-drawer.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'local-pickup.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<script
  src="{{ 'hz-cart-bubble-sync.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>
<quick-add-dialog id="quick-add-dialog">
  <dialog
    class="quick-add-modal dialog-modal color-custom-popover"
    ref="dialog"
    scroll-lock
  >
    {%- comment -%} SERVE FIX: `button` class dropped (Phase-8 ratified
      precedent — inert under Horizon's .button:not(.button-unstyled) guard;
      Dawn's guardless .button painted it black and its position:relative
      beat the modal's absolute placement via the cascade inversion). The
      per-consumer shim (popup-link close precedent) lives in
      quick-add-styles. {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      ref="closeButton"
      on:click="/closeDialog"
      class="button-unstyled close-button quick-add-modal__close"
      aria-label="Close dialog"
    >
      {{- 'hz-icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
    </button>

    <product-component
      id="quick-add-modal-content"
      class="quick-add-modal__content"
      view-event-trigger="dialog"
      data-section-id="hz-quick-add-product"
    ></product-component>
  </dialog>
</quick-add-dialog>

{% render 'quick-add-modal-styles' %}
